# Build inputs only. `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile used to drag in the local toolchain
# state: web/node_modules (hundreds of MB, and it invalidates the Go layer cache on every
# install) and .data/, which holds data.db with the JWT signing secret plus
# database.json with the PostgreSQL DSN. Neither may end up in a layer.
.git
.data
.env
.env.*
web/node_modules
web/dist
*.exe
